<title>USA: Starter sees Q3 revs, eps be flat or down.</title>
<headline>Starter sees Q3 revs, eps be flat or down.</headline>
<dateline>NEW HAVEN, Conn. 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Starter Corp said on Wednesday it expected its third quarter earnings and revenues to be similar to or slightly below results in the same period last year, due to a change in retailer order patterns.</p>
<p>In the 1995 third quarter, Starter had $165 million in revenues and earned $0.38 per share.</p>
